{"crw-nogi-14198":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"hello"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前生田のえりか様と飛鳥とまあやの三人でコンビニに行ってる時の事なんですけど、\nいくちゃんに\n『そう言えば誰が愛されまあやってつけたの？』\nっと聞かれて\n『確かに。誰だろ？』\nってなった和田まあやです(。>д<)(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰だろ？なんかなんでこんなに浸透してるんだろ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、皆にピッタリっていってもらえるからいいやっ(///ω///)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/20/0000.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(えっ!?ジュースいる？？(真顔＆棒読み)www)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい！今回の取り扱い説明書メンバーは、\nまあやの大好きな大好きな大好きな大好きな〜\nえ？もういいって？大好き大好きうるさいって？\nアーイ(^○^)メンバーは........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/20/2966038/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アメージングー＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(二人で東スポのしたときの写メ！)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名前\n高山一実(今回こそ漢字あってる？名前！)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アダ名\nダンブルじぃじ！(懐かしい！個人的にまあやが呼んでるだけですけども)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"癖\n常に自分のお尻を叩いてます。(しかもグーで！痛そう！実はMなのかな？笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"口癖\n大丈夫よぉ〜です！(左の手を腰に、右手はバイバイみたいに振りながら！笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"性格\nめぇ〜っちゃいい！私ね、大好きなの！憧れるの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのねぇ、宿題教えてくれたり、真剣に自分のことのように相談のってくれるの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まって本当に良いことしか浮かばないよ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"う〜ん、あっでもね、かずみんはいつも\n『ポジティブポジティブ』\n言ってるけど本当はネガティブなの！\nまあやは年下だけど、時々守ってあげたくなっちゃうぐらい大好き！ エヘッ(*^▽^)/★*☆♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやの部屋には、かずみんからもらったぬいぐるみが飾ってあるの♪\n良いでしょ~(*´ω｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとねあとねぇ聞きたい？ww\nかずみんのお母さんも凄く凄く美人なんだよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃ~ん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/09/20/2966038/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元の風景！笑(この写メメンバーにも送りつけたw)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに2日だけ地元に帰りました\nこれは、お母さんとお祖母ちゃんで倉敷にお買い物に行く時に撮った写真です\nそういえば、倉敷のとこに買い物いってCDショップ行ったら自分のサインあったの\n前にひめたんと二人で仕事にいったのを思い出して懐かしかった\n(今も飾ってくれてて嬉しかったァァ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやの地元は台風の影響はほとんどなかったけど、皆は大丈夫ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもお世話になってる日村さん\nいつも まあや達に優しくしてくれる日村さん、元気になって本当に良かったです~(*^-^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントありがとうございます(*^^*ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近コメントで乃木どこの方言告白を見て好きになった♪\nって人がいて♪嬉しい~(///ω///)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっあと、前回の乃木どこの放送で\n裸足でリレーする！っていったけど、地元でだし、友達とだし、もうしてないもんっ((o(￣ー￣)o))www\n(皆は裸足で走った事ある？)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"氣志團の時の服装は\n撮り忘れた・・・(T-T)\nあの服めっちゃかっこ良かったのにぃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"土曜日は握手会だね~\nスッゴク楽しみに待ってます♪\n気を付けて来てください(^◇^)\nBYE"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-6171":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n>"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はっはっはくしょんっ\nじゃなくてー\nせーのっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁ今回も始まりましたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやしゃんblog"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コンメントを見て気づいたこと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！その前に、\n人形焼きのこと人気焼き！ってかいてたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ショック"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、タイトルの文字数の制限についてコメントくれたかた！\n私のは飛鳥みたいにかけません?\n飛鳥のタイトル考えたとき、\nこれどこまでかけんのー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってびっくりしたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のは、\n入力の上限を越えました！\nこれ以上入力できません。\nってなるんよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、みんなが考えてくれたタイトルを全部使うのは無理っぽい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"sorry"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、BLT&乃木坂46のコラボTシャツ？ん？ちがう！？\nえっと、まあやがデザインしたTシャツを購入してくださった方が何人かいて、とってもうれすったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張って作ったかいがありますよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Thank You\nそして、昨日はそのTシャツにサインを書いたりしたよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だれがあたるかなぁ？\n皆さんのことを考えながら作るのは幸せで楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\nタンブルじぃじ！\nのこと、かずみさん！って書いてて、\n不思議に思ったかたもいましたね！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもダンブルじぃじなんですけど、ダンブルじぃじで、\nわからなかった方が何人か前いたので、\n今回はかずみさんにしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみさんにとってもらいやした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪が伸びすぎて気持ちわるいですねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"切らなければっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"汗汗汗\nそして、前髪も長いのー(*_*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほらねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、昨日のレッスン中、\n腹がすきすぎたので、\nお腹すいたゲームを\nダブルひなと、あしゅとまあやでしました！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひたすら、リズムに合わせて\n今食べたい好きな食べ物を言っていくゲームです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、よけいにお腹空きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これを何回もやったよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(※ちなみに、あしゅは、苺ミルクを一回も言いませんでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":")"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤は斎藤でも、斉藤ちいちゃんとのツーショットです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、blogのタイトルは引き続き、皆さんが考えてくださったのを使いたいと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も考えてくださったかた\n有り難うございました！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと、まあやを動物に例えると...の質問にも答えてくれてありがとうございます?\n小動物が多かったですね?\nニヤニヤしながら読みました?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では今から畠中様と約束した集合場所にいき、\n焼き肉を食べにいきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん焼肉は好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長崎イベント"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日頑張った成果を発揮できたらな！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非遊びに来てねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではお決まりのーーーー\n最後のセリフを\nせーーーのっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいちゃっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃなくって、\nせーーーーーーーーーのっっっっっっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/28/5359632/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-12237":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁ、いよいよ、今日でプリンシパルも大千秋楽を\n迎えます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"稽古から早二ヶ月、\n長かったプリンシパルも\n今日で終わり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さみしいけれど、\n次へ進みたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"役を勝ち取るだけじゃない、\n役以外にもたくさん、\n確実に得たものはありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後、どんな形で終わりたいか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怪我なく無事に終わればいいかな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガジ頑張ります！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、とりあえず乃木坂最高ー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-c